url: 'https://ds-preclinical-therapeutics-explore.vercel.app'
abstract: >-
  A curated, citation-forward web application for exploring
  preclinical pharmacological and dietary interventions tested
  in Down syndrome animal models. Standardizes intervention
  metadata, biological context, and three-axis outcome
  annotations across 232 experimental conditions, 38 compounds,
  71 peer-reviewed publications, 22 animal models, and 4 species.
